    "name": "Spring Base API",
    "description": "Employee Management API — layered Spring Boot backend.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Run `docker compose up -d`\n2. Run app with `mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=dev,seed`\n3. Run **Admin Login** first — token is saved automatically.\n\n**Default admin:** admin@example.com / admin123",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
